<title>JAPAN: Italy launches 3.45% 20-yr Euroyen bonds--Nikko.</title>
<headline>Italy launches 3.45% 20-yr Euroyen bonds--Nikko.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Euroyen issue was</p>
<p>announced by Nikko Securities on Tuesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  Italy</p>
<p> AMT		 100 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    3.45 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY	  24 March 2017</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 99.80</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  24 March 1997</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P AA, Moody's Aa2</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Nikko Europe</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8785</p>
</text>
